# Window icons (spec 058): one per window on the UI layer, shown on its button in the button bar.
# A question mark for help, an open book for the journal, a banner for the party's orders, and
# a turning arrow for putting every window back in its place. Spec 059: a purse for the shop, a
# folded map with its X for the area map, and three falling bars for the party tally.
# Light from the top-left; ink outlines so they read on any button state.
category = ui
size = 16x16

